00:05:29.295 --> 00:05:31.297
or drones, such as some of the drones

00:05:31.297 --> 00:05:32.432
that you just talked about, Wolf.

00:05:32.432 --> 00:05:32.732
And that's

00:05:32.732 --> 00:05:34.200
why we've been prioritizing air

00:05:34.200 --> 00:05:35.368
defense capabilities for them.

00:05:35.368 --> 00:05:35.902
And look,

00:05:35.902 --> 00:05:38.071
just look, over the last 24 hours or so,

00:05:38.504 --> 00:05:41.541
the Russians killed almost two dozen

00:05:41.541 --> 00:05:43.076
or actually maybe more than two dozen

00:05:44.143 --> 00:05:44.744
Ukrainian.

00:05:44.744 --> 00:05:45.078
Some of

00:05:45.078 --> 00:05:45.278
them were

00:05:45.278 --> 00:05:47.213
