00:05:57.156 --> 00:05:58.291
I can tell you that

00:05:58.291 --> 00:05:58.925
the Ukrainians

00:05:58.925 --> 00:06:00.793
are going to want to be

00:06:00.793 --> 00:06:02.261
and they will be ready.

00:06:02.261 --> 00:06:03.363
The former Russian

00:06:03.363 --> 00:06:05.498
president, Dmitry Medvedev,

00:06:05.498 --> 00:06:07.667
