00:06:19.479 --> 00:06:20.012
I don't know

00:06:20.012 --> 00:06:21.347
that we've had direct conversations

00:06:21.347 --> 00:06:22.181
with them about Mr.

00:06:22.181 --> 00:06:23.950
Medvedev's comments here,

00:06:23.950 --> 00:06:24.951
you know, just recently.

00:06:24.951 --> 00:06:26.686
But we have clearly sent

00:06:26.686 --> 00:06:27.520
strong messages

00:06:27.520 --> 00:06:29.555
publicly and privately to Russia

00:06:29.856 --> 00:06:31.290
about what they're doing in Ukraine.

00:06:31.290 --> 00:06:32.692
It's illegal, it's unprovoked.

00:06:32.692 --> 00:06:33.726
It needs to stop.

00:06:33.726 --> 00:06:34.660
And in the meantime,

00:06:34.660 --> 00:06:35.862
we're doing everything we can

00:06:35.862 --> 00:06:36.662
to make sure

00:06:36.662 --> 00:06:37.797
that President Zelenskiy

00:06:37.797 --> 00:06:38.865
and his armed forces

00:06:38.865 --> 00:06:40.533
can continue to defend themselves.

00:06:40.533 --> 00:06:42.402
But look, the Russians have made no bones

00:06:42.402 --> 00:06:43.202
about the fact

00:06:43.202 --> 00:06:43.836
that they don't

00:06:43.836 --> 00:06:45.405
that they want to decapitate

00:06:45.405 --> 00:06:47.840
the Zelenskiy administration.

00:06:48.007 --> 00:06:49.842
They've made no bones about the fact

00:06:49.842 --> 00:06:51.310
that civilians are certainly

00:06:51.310 --> 00:06:52.712
in the realm of the possible

00:06:52.712 --> 00:06:53.946
in terms of their targeting.

00:06:53.946 --> 00:06:55.681
And they've made no bones about the fact

00:06:55.681 --> 00:06:56.416
that they don't believe

00:06:56.416 --> 00:06:57.683
Ukraine should even exist

00:06:57.683 --> 00:06:59.652
