00:06:59.652 --> 00:07:00.720
I know you've slammed

00:07:00.720 --> 00:07:03.089
Russia for, quote, lying

00:07:03.089 --> 00:07:04.557
that the alleged U.S.

00:07:04.557 --> 00:07:05.792
that the United States

00:07:05.792 --> 00:07:07.160
allegedly directed

00:07:07.160 --> 00:07:09.262
that drone strike on the Kremlin.

00:07:09.262 --> 00:07:10.863
But what tools does the U.S.

00:07:10.863 --> 00:07:12.698
