00:07:17.136 --> 00:07:18.271
Well, I don't think we're going

00:07:18.271 --> 00:07:20.273
to try to investigate this, Wolf.

00:07:20.273 --> 00:07:21.174
I mean, this

00:07:21.507 --> 00:07:23.376
whether it happened or not, it's

00:07:23.376 --> 00:07:24.377
not the kind of thing that I think

00:07:24.377 --> 00:07:25.611
