00:07:25.611 --> 00:07:26.646
in investigating.

00:07:26.646 --> 00:07:27.480
Clearly,

00:07:27.480 --> 00:07:28.848
we'd like to learn more about that

00:07:28.848 --> 00:07:30.316
and we'll continue to do that.

00:07:30.316 --> 00:07:32.218
And talking to the Ukrainians and

00:07:32.218 --> 00:07:33.386
and trying to do the best

00:07:33.386 --> 00:07:34.487
we can to piece it together,

00:07:34.487 --> 00:07:35.955
but we're not on a big fact

00:07:35.955 --> 00:07:36.756
finding mission here.

00:07:36.756 --> 00:07:38.624
What we are on a mission to do

00:07:38.624 --> 00:07:40.293
is make sure that Ukraine can continue

00:07:40.293 --> 00:07:41.194
to defend itself,

00:07:41.194 --> 00:07:43.262
give them the tools, the capabilities,

00:07:43.262 --> 00:07:44.630
the training that they need

00:07:44.630 --> 00:07:46.232
as they get ready to conduct

00:07:46.232 --> 00:07:47.567
operations here in the spring

00:07:47.567 --> 00:07:48.668
when the weather gets better.

00:07:48.668 --> 00:07:49.402
Would Russia

00:07:49.402 --> 00:07:52.004
have an incentive of John to stage

00:07:52.004 --> 00:07:53.606
what's called a false flag

00:07:53.606 --> 00:07:54.307
operation

00:07:54.307 --> 00:07:56.576
just ahead of its annual victory day

