00:08:12.992 --> 00:08:14.160
We're not speculating.

00:08:14.160 --> 00:08:15.761
We're not hypothesizing.

00:08:15.761 --> 00:08:17.096
I'm not calling it

00:08:17.096 --> 00:08:19.031
