00:08:19.031 --> 00:08:20.199
We're clearly look,

00:08:20.199 --> 00:08:21.400
the Russians have conducted

00:08:21.400 --> 00:08:23.236
false flag operations in the past.

00:08:23.236 --> 00:08:24.437
It's a playbook.

00:08:24.437 --> 00:08:26.272
It's a play from their playbook that

00:08:26.272 --> 00:08:27.006
