00:09:04.310 --> 00:09:05.645
They did deny that.

00:09:05.645 --> 00:09:07.346
We'll let them speak for

00:09:07.346 --> 00:09:08.948
for you know, for themselves.

00:09:08.948 --> 00:09:10.783
And certainly we noted

00:09:10.783 --> 00:09:11.450
that they came out

00:09:11.450 --> 00:09:12.184
very, very quickly

00:09:12.184 --> 00:09:12.919
and said

00:09:13.052 --> 00:09:14.554
