00:09:14.554 --> 00:09:15.721
Again, we're not

00:09:15.721 --> 00:09:15.988
you know,

00:09:15.988 --> 00:09:16.689
we're not going to conduct

00:09:16.689 --> 00:09:18.224
an investigation here.

00:09:18.224 --> 00:09:18.925
What we want to do

00:09:18.925 --> 00:09:19.759
is make sure that Ukraine

00:09:19.759 --> 00:09:20.493
can defend itself.

00:09:20.493 --> 00:09:21.661
That's where the focus is.

00:09:21.661 --> 00:09:23.262
John Kirby over at the White House, thank

00:09:23.262 --> 00:09:23.996
you very much.

